\section{Sugar-Sugar human benchmarking}
\label{app:sugarstugar}

Sugar-Sugar (\url{https://sugar-sugar.study}) is an ethics-approved web-based study (University Medical Center Rostock, ref.\ A~2026-0064) where participants view 3 hours of real CGM data and draw their 60-minute prediction by placing 12 points on a chart.
The study targets $>$200 adults in a 2$\times$2 design crossing diabetes status with CGM experience, and will be described in a separate publication.
It is currently in recruitment and will establish the first published human accuracy reference for glucose forecasting.

